只输出严格JSON，恰好包含id（metadata.id原样）、summary_zh（15到140个Unicode字符，通常40到100字）、category（枚举）、tags（2到5个不重复关键词，每个最多30字符）、confidence（0到1，仅自评）、insufficient_evidence（布尔）、evidence（1到3个对象，每个恰好包含paragraph_id、fact）、limitations（0到5个字符串）。只选择输入中长度20至120字符的完整片段编号；fact是该片段支持的中文事实转述。不要输出quote，不要自行抄写、拼接、删改或补造引用。程序会按编号附上原文。一个编号只用一次；最多3条证据。不得增加字段。
摘要和limitations保留会改变功能意义的前提、平台例外和限制：设密码后才认证、页面保持打开才提醒、依赖外部组件、估算不等于保证。只写已实现功能，不将规划当完成。证据不足就标记，不编造。
图像识别/分类不是媒体创作，没有贴切类别归other；量化、计算与领域研究归search-research，不因多智能体实现归agents-automation；模型/CLI适配与插件开发工具归coding-development；市场/精选目录按搜索发现归search-research。不要按附属同步、备份或评论功能分类。不要推断本机客户端等于本地模型。
摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Protect sensitive tool output and cross-tool data flows in DeepSeek Harness, with deterministic rules, provenance receipts and a bilingual live security beacon.","id":"gh:1299059971","install_available":true,"language":"TypeScript","name":"dsh-riskproof","slug":"onlyqzq/dsh-riskproof","topics":["agent-security","ai-agent","data-loss-prevention","deepseek-harness","dsh-plugin","prompt-injection","provenance","tool-security"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Protect sensitive tool output and cross-tool data flows in DeepSeek Harness, with deterministic rule"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"s, provenance receipts and a bilingual live security beacon."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# RiskProof"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"**Stop sensitive data from leaving through AI tools, and see where it came from.**"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"RiskProof tracks cross-tool data flows and blocks sensitive tool output in DeepSeek Harness.\nA persi"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"stent security beacon shows redacted execution receipts. Deterministic rules need no extra LLM calls"},{"id":"p4s3","text":"tent security beacon shows redacted execution receipts. Deterministic rules need no extra LLM calls."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"English · 简体中文"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"[](https://www.npmjs.com/package/dsh-riskproof) [](https://github.com/onlyqzq/dsh-riskproof/actions/"},{"id":"p6s2","text":"mjs.com/package/dsh-riskproof) [](https://github.com/onlyqzq/dsh-riskproof/actions/workflows/ci.yml)"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"## Try the rules before setting up DSH"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"With Node.js 22.19+, run four synthetic protection examples:"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"No DSH profile, model API key or repository checkout is needed. npm downloads the\npackage; the insta"},{"id":"p10s2","text":"lled rehearsal runs locally with the default balanced policy.\nIt checks web-influenced commands, cus"},{"id":"p10s3","text":"tomer data egress, changed tool schemas and\nread-only task restrictions. All four should show `✓` an"},{"id":"p10s4","text":"d `deny`. Use `--json` for\nstructured results. This demonstrates the rules; it does not activate pro"},{"id":"p10s5","text":"tection\nor validate your configuration. Install into DSH below to protect real tool calls."},{"id":"p11s1","text":"## Quick Start"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"Requires Node.js 22.19+, with DSH and pnpm installed:"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"Confirm the output includes `name: dsh-riskproof`, restart the Web profile, and click\nits security b"},{"id":"p14s2","text":"eacon. Then enter this directly in the conversation composer:"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"Four isolated rehearsals show web content influencing a command, customer data transfer,\na tool sche"},{"id":"p16s2","text":"ma change and a read-only restriction. They use synthetic inputs, read no private files, run no shel"},{"id":"p16s3","text":"l commands,\nsend no email, and do not enter live protection counts. RiskProof's rules and direct sla"},{"id":"p16s4","text":"sh\ncommands make no extra model calls; ordinary DSH model usage keeps its normal cost."},{"id":"p17s1","text":"See installation and troubleshooting for the complete steps."},{"id":"p18s1","text":"| Compatibility | Verified scope |"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"| Node.js | 22.19+; see the CI matrix |\n| DSH | Install/tool pipeline: 0.1.0-rc.7, 0.1.2-rc.1 and 0."},{"id":"p19s2","text":"2.1-rc.4; Web: 0.1.2-rc.1 and 0.2.1-rc.4 |\n| Model | Deterministic rules need no reviewer model or a"},{"id":"p19s3","text":"dditional API key |\n| Language | Beacon, overview and reports: `experience.language: en` or `zh-CN` "},{"id":"p19s4","text":"PI key |\n| Language | Beacon, overview and reports: `experience.language: en` or `zh-CN` (default) |"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"Newer DSH versions require separate verification. See validation evidence\nfor the historical 0.1 res"},{"id":"p20s2","text":"ults and the v0.7 validation record for the current release."},{"id":"p21s1","text":"## Start here"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"| Goal | Read |"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"| Install and try it | Quick Start · Installation |\n| Tune protection and task scope | Configuration"},{"id":"p23s2","text":" |\n| Understand or contribute to the project | Architecture · Development |\n| Push code or publish a"},{"id":"p23s3","text":" version | Manual release guide (中文) |\n| Find security boundaries and version records | Documentatio"},{"id":"p23s4","text":"| Manual release guide (中文) |\n| Find security boundaries and version records | Documentation index |"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"## See protection beside your conversation"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"A persistent **RiskProof security beacon** sits beside the DSH conversation. Ordinary tool\n[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"## See configuration gaps and what to do next"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"Expand **Protection checks** in the beacon overview, or run `/riskproof doctor` to inspect\nexecution"},{"id":"p27s2","text":" mode, evidence recording, provenance, label propagation, chain detection,\ncredential output protect"},{"id":"p27s3","text":"ion and effective rule posture. Explicit overrides that relax a\nstrict preset remain visible. Recent"},{"id":"p27s4","text":" risk cards also explain the next step.\nThese are read-only configuration checks, with no test tool "},{"id":"p27s5","text":"dispatch, credential reads or\nextra activity counts. See the protection checks guide."},{"id":"p28s1","text":"## What RiskProof answers"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"Most tool-permission plugins answer one question: *is this tool allowed?*"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"RiskProof answers a different one:"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"> **Where did the data in this tool call come from, what did it flow through, and where is it about "},{"id":"p31s2","text":"e did the data in this tool call come from, what did it flow through, and where is it about to go?**"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"A single tool call is usually safe. The composition is not."},{"id":"p33s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"## Why RiskProof"},{"id":"p35s1","text":"| Tool-name allowlists      | RiskProof                              |"},{"id":"p36s1","text":"| Is this tool allowed?     | Where did this data come from?         |\n| Single call               |"},{"id":"p36s2","text":" Cross-tool flow                        |\n| Tool name                 | Provenance + taint          "},{"id":"p36s3","text":"           |\n| Static rule               | Stateful attack chain                  |\n| Permission dec"},{"id":"p36s4","text":"ision       | Evidence-backed execution decision     |"},{"id":"p37s1","text":"RiskProof is a layer over the DSH Tool Runtime, not another Agent Runtime. It never re-implements to"},{"id":"p37s2","text":"ol dispatch, approval, or lifecycle — it observes and decides."},{"id":"p38s1","text":"## Features"},{"id":"p39s1","text":"## How it works"},{"id":"p40s1","text":"RiskProof hooks the native DSH tool pipeline:"},{"id":"p41s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p42s1","text":"- **Classification** is deterministic (tool name + description + schema), configurable, and never us"},{"id":"p42s2","text":"es an LLM.\n- **Provenance** uses exact and bounded substring matching over a per-session context ind"},{"id":"p42s3","text":"ex.\n- **Taint** is additive; only an exact operator-approved declassifier can remove selected inheri"},{"id":"p42s4","text":"ted labels.\n- **Decisions** are deterministic, explainable, and testable."},{"id":"p43s1","text":"See docs/architecture.md."},{"id":"p44s1","text":"## Security boundaries"},{"id":"p45s1","text":"RiskProof protects **supported observable tool-call flows** through DSH:"},{"id":"p46s1","text":"- DSH tool calls through the supported `tools/pre-execute` / `tools/post-execute` / `tools/result` p"},{"id":"p46s2","text":"aths\n- supported observable provenance (exact / bounded substring matching)\n- configured sensitive f"},{"id":"p46s3","text":"lows and cross-tool attack patterns"},{"id":"p47s1","text":"RiskProof does **not** replace:"},{"id":"p48s1","text":"- OS sandbox / process isolation\n- network firewall / SSRF protection\n- endpoint security / malware "},{"id":"p48s2","text":"scanning\n- credential vaults\n- full semantic DLP"},{"id":"p49s1","text":"See docs/security-model.md for the complete threat model and known limitations."},{"id":"p50s1","text":"## Security reporting"},{"id":"p51s1","text":"Please report vulnerabilities privately. See SECURITY.md."}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
